    "prose": "Expand & Mine\nWritten from a built-in template.\nPlace a Mine beacon covering a scrap seam you do not cover yet, and walk home while it digs.\n\nRoute\n  1. place_mine: place a beacon at a site covering the nearest scrap seam you do not cover yet (nearest by travel, read when the step starts), tagged \"mine\", on a Mine mandate, at normal Quartermaster priority (16.5 s on site).\n    Give up after 2:00.\n    On failure, move on to the next step.\n  2. back_home: walk to the safest own beacon.\n\nRules\n  1. \"flee\", when the commander is at or below 40% HP and the commander took damage in the last 3 s:\n    1. flee_to_safety: walk to the safest own beacon.\n    2. flee_wait: hold for 8 s.\n    Then carry on with the route.\n    Fires at most 3 times, and no sooner than every 30 s.\n\nIf the commander dies\n  On respawn, carry on from the step the route was on.\n  After 2 deaths the fallback takes over.\n\nFallback\n  Hold at the safest own beacon.\n\nBudget\n  5 of 128 size units.\n  16.5 s standing at a beacon along the route.\n",
